{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi01_title", "source_sha256": "7a2ac6adb69b5c8e9f34c0745c273656c2c5a164b92766de170c7e5ee7e3b902", "ja": "海美とおでかけ1", "zh": "和海美出门1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9e15e98d4ff5e5b92219ae7275c28a39fecf6105b45b354a511fa144d757910c", "ja": "海美とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和海美出门时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "52ea00e422e30fafde55b82cd1ea448c92069ebb916e910d416a06b432f86547", "ja": "（今日の海美は、福島の温泉リゾート施設で仕事。\n施設では現在、ハワイアンなイベントが開催中だ）", "zh": "（今天海美的工作是在福岛的温泉度假设施进行。设施内目前正在举办夏威夷风情的活动）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi01_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "6965e9bb097b317248dfa2875aee5b087dddc193d3dbfe58333878c1fc5a50e2", "ja": "北東エリアにハワイがあるなんて思わなかったよーっ！\n{$P$}、私のフラダンス見てくれた？", "zh": "没想到东北地区居然也有夏威夷呢——！\n{$P$}，你看了我的草裙舞吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1563bf0d3c5dd6e21836980a5640293ad698b06d30c0d1aab27e8a275c815585", "ja": "もちろん！　常夏の島に来たみたいだったよ。\n海美はどんなダンスでも上手なんだな。", "zh": "当然！让人感觉就像来到了常夏之岛一样。\n海美不管什么舞都跳得很好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi01_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "5d81aeaf13b3528012d112d9048b2b4de99b879e55e4388aa33a86a0674cd313", "ja": "えへ、えへへへへ……♪\nそんな、何でもなんてことないけど……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿嘿……♪\n哪有，我也不是跳什么舞都很擅长……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi01_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "a0d402e6a001cb494381ea82fd35970d2570f22ec6420a347458d3c0dbba67eb", "ja": "あっ……そうだ、{$P$}！\n私、あれもやってみたいんだ。火をグルグル回すやつ！", "zh": "啊……对了，{$P$}！\n我还想试试那个。就是让火呼呼旋转的那个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9f3567c6c2973e4705213436d0b4c91efef5866369797225dc679a0f7eaa4954", "ja": "火をグルグル回す……？　いや、急には難しいかな。\n海美、またの機会にしないか？", "zh": "旋转火焰……？不，突然要做这个可能有点难吧。\n海美，下次有机会再试试吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi01_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "50d645e71a93f6b7b13d4fd1ea7d0da64e95bc1bbd5bbff8ba3d152ae9423070", "ja": "そっかー、残念っ！\n次は絶対チャレンジしたいなーっ！", "zh": "这样啊——真遗憾！\n下次我一定要挑战一下——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi01_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "2266e298c1863abb0344aea2b1611c205a2c0f3b41712288521f047c7700a4ed", "ja": "そしたら私、はりきっていっぱい回すよー！\nぐるぐる・ファイヤー！　あははっ☆", "zh": "那样的话，我就兴冲冲地多转几圈啦——！\n转转・火力全开！啊哈哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_029umi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_029umi01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8a25466b8b0b289e36bd4e1021240795c2592cc2ff04b15e9ca464daf3afae03", "ja": "（臆さず何にでも挑戦していけるのは、海美の強みだ。\n危険のない程度に、伸ばせるといいな……！）", "zh": "（不畏惧地挑战任何事，是海美的优点。希望她能在确保安全的范围内继续发扬下去……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
